[12.339891, "o", "Lifecycle Impact\r\nMint: 4vJ9JU1bJJE96FWSJKvHsmmFADCg4gpZQff4P3bkLKi\r\nScenario: synthetic-dashboard-policy (1)\r\nBefore: 2026-09-26 23:59:59.999999999 UTC — Active\r\nAfter: 2026-09-28 00:00:00 UTC — Expired\r\nTechnical state: unchanged (same frozen snapshot SHA-256 a1de42870f7f7781aa3b20613a1b2e7f430f2046d583c6e62999f23c9c16077d)\r\n\r\nEntities evaluated: 1\r\nPositive public balances: 1\r\nZero public balances: 0\r\nCannot be judged-role positive balances: 0\r\nOther/unknown uncertain-role positive balances: 0\r\nEconomic meaning changed: 1\r\nUnaffected: 0\r\nRequiresTransition: 0\r\nStaleExposure: 1\r\nUnresolved: 0\r\nVerified liquidity venues: 0\r\nStale protocol exposures: 0\r\n\r\nLifecycle semantics are external assertions and explicit scenario assumptions, not facts decoded from chain bytes\r\n\r\nEvaluation times are hypothetical semantic views of the same frozen observations, not historical or future chain captures\r\n\r\nPhase 2 entity balances and Phase 3 protocol vault balances retain their separate RPC contexts; protocol amounts overlap holder amounts and must not be added\r\n\r\nOnly public SPL account amounts are quantified; withheld fees, encrypted amounts, scaled displays and LP entitlements are excluded\r\n\r\nNo transferability, swap, withdrawal, conversion, recovery, exitability, market value or stranded-position claim is proved; every execution status is Not evaluated\r\n\r\nExactly the captured entities and verified venues are evaluated; roles, owners, successor routes and undiscovered integrations are not inferred\r\n"]
